<p data-v-039ffd48="" class="para">Kinopoisk — online cinema, collections and ratings<br><br>There is always something to watch<br>The Kinopoisk app has excellent quality movies and collections by genre, characters, and your preferences. Oscar-winning movies and some of the Oscar 2023 nominees are also available.<br><br>Music inside<br>You can listen to playlists to suit your mood, your favorite songs, and audiobooks right from the app.<br><br>For children and adults<br>— Go to the safe children's section and don't worry about what your child is watching.<br>— Choose a voiceover: original, dubbed, or "Kubik v Kube" without censorship. Subtitles are available.<br>— Watch films nominated for the 2023 Oscars and the TV series everyone is talking about.<br><br>Find and choose<br>— Rate to get personalized recommendations.<br>— Explore the classics, discover new things with editorial selections.<br><br>Subscription options<br>Yandex Plus subscription:<br>— Kinopoisk exclusives;<br>— full access to Yandex Music;<br>— cashback points in Yandex services;<br>— bonuses and discounts from partners;<br>— you can share with 3 (three) loved ones: each will have their own profile.<br><br>Plus subscription with Amediateka:<br>— all the benefits of Plus;<br>— Amediateka films and TV series.</p>